    locator "section/7515/note/2";
    text en official """Effective Date of Repeal
Repeal effective Jan. 1, 1977, see section 1202(i) of Pub. L. 94–455, set out as an Effective Date of 1976 Amendment note under section 6103 of this title.""";
    content_hash "sha256:5e602c21c88b3a93de00da2fec25bfedd71233fd6d4a8432530cb5809da80c21";
